   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Demonstratives in the nominative and accusative",
     "texto": [
      "Demonstratives take the same endings as the definite article:",
      "1. **In the nominative (subject):**",
      "Masculine: **dieser Mantel** (this coat).",
      "Feminine: **diese Jacke** (this jacket).",
      "Neuter: **dieses Hemd** (this shirt).",
      "Plural: **diese Schuhe** (these shoes).",
      "2. **In the accusative (direct object):**",
      "Only the masculine changes: **diesen Mantel** (this coat) / **diesen Rock** (this skirt).",
      "The other genders stay the same: **diese Jacke**, **dieses Hemd**, **diese Schuhe**.",
      "To ask: **Welcher Mantel?** (which coat?), **Welche Jacke?** (which jacket?), **Welches Hemd?** (which shirt?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
